---
import InnerPage from '../../layouts/InnerPage.astro';
---

<InnerPage
	title="Ekanta"
	description="Ekanta by TeleTrex: a private, WebGPU-accelerated LLM chat app for Mac. Run powerful AI models entirely on your device — no cloud, no API keys, no data leaving your machine."
>
	<!-- Hero -->
	<div class="ek-hero">
		<div class="ek-hero__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<div class="ek-hero__glow2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<div class="ek-hero__badge">Free Download &nbsp;·&nbsp; macOS 12+</div>
		<div class="ek-hero__title" role="heading" aria-level="1">Ekanta</div>
		<p class="ek-hero__tagline">Your conversations stay on your machine. Full stop.</p>
		<p class="ek-hero__desc">
			A Mac app that runs large language models entirely on your GPU — no cloud,
			no API keys, no data ever leaving your device.
		</p>
		<div class="ek-hero__buttons">
			<a class="ek-dl ek-dl--primary" href="/downloads/Ekanta-1.0.0-arm64.dmg" download>
				<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
					<path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/>
					<polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/>
					<line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/>
				</svg>
				Apple Silicon
				<span class="ek-dl__sub">arm64 · 90 MB</span>
			</a>
			<a class="ek-dl" href="/downloads/Ekanta-1.0.0.dmg" download>
				<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
					<path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/>
					<polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/>
					<line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/>
				</svg>
				Intel Mac
				<span class="ek-dl__sub">x64 · 97 MB</span>
			</a>
		</div>
		<p class="ek-hero__note">Requires macOS 12 Monterey or later. Models are downloaded on first use and cached locally.</p>
	</div>

	<!-- Feature pills -->
	<div class="ek-pills" role="list" aria-label="Key features">
		<span class="ek-pill" role="listitem"><span class="ek-pill__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>100% Local</span>
		<span class="ek-pill" role="listitem"><span class="ek-pill__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>GPU-Accelerated</span>
		<span class="ek-pill" role="listitem"><span class="ek-pill__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>13 Models</span>
		<span class="ek-pill" role="listitem"><span class="ek-pill__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>OpenAI-Compatible API</span>
		<span class="ek-pill" role="listitem"><span class="ek-pill__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>No Subscription</span>
	</div>

	<h2 class="section-title"><span class="ek-gt">Private by design</span></h2>
	<p class="prose-block">
		Most AI tools route your conversations through remote servers — your questions, your context,
		your data. Ekanta is different. Every model runs entirely on your Mac using WebGPU acceleration.
		Nothing is transmitted. There is no server. Your conversations exist only on your device.
	</p>
	<p class="prose-block">
		This matters for legal teams reviewing contracts, founders stress-testing strategy, clinicians
		thinking through cases, and anyone who should not be pasting sensitive material into a chat box
		connected to the internet.
	</p>

	<h2 class="section-title"><span class="ek-gt">Powerful models, no subscription</span></h2>
	<p class="prose-block">
		Ekanta ships with a curated catalogue of open-weight models optimised for Mac hardware — from
		fast half-billion-parameter models for quick tasks to 8B reasoning models that rival much
		larger cloud offerings. Models are downloaded once and cached. After that, they work offline,
		indefinitely, with no ongoing cost.
	</p>
	<ul class="prose-block ek-list">
		<li>Llama 3.1 &amp; 3.2 (Meta) — balanced quality and speed</li>
		<li>DeepSeek-R1 distilled — chain-of-thought reasoning at 1.5B, 7B, and 8B</li>
		<li>Qwen 2.5 (Alibaba) — strong coding and multilingual support</li>
		<li>Mistral 7B — a reliable general-purpose benchmark</li>
		<li>Gemma 2 (Google) — efficient instruction-following at 2B and 9B</li>
	</ul>

	<h2 class="section-title"><span class="ek-gt">A local API server, built in</span></h2>
	<p class="prose-block">
		Ekanta runs an OpenAI-compatible API server on your machine the moment it opens. Once a model
		is loaded, any tool that speaks to OpenAI — coding assistants, automation scripts, Claude Code,
		custom agents — can be pointed at Ekanta instead. No proxy, no configuration, no cloud bill.
	</p>
	<p class="prose-block">
		The server also exposes Anthropic's <code>/v1/messages</code> format, so you can point
		Claude Code directly at Ekanta with a single environment variable and use local models as your
		coding assistant backend.
	</p>

	<h2 class="section-title"><span class="ek-gt">Built for the Mac</span></h2>
	<p class="prose-block">
		Ekanta uses WebGPU with Metal to accelerate inference on both Apple Silicon and Intel graphics.
		The interface respects the macOS design language: native title bar, full keyboard navigation,
		and a conversation history that persists across sessions. It feels like it belongs on your machine
		because it was built for your machine.
	</p>

	<div class="ek-two-col">
		<div class="ek-panel">
			<h2 class="ek-panel__title"><span class="ek-gt">Best for</span></h2>
			<ul class="ek-list ek-list--compact">
				<li>Professionals who handle sensitive information and cannot use cloud AI services.</li>
				<li>Developers who want a local inference backend for tools, agents, and coding assistants.</li>
				<li>Teams subject to data-residency or compliance requirements that rule out SaaS AI.</li>
				<li>Anyone who wants capable AI without a recurring subscription.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
		<div class="ek-panel">
			<h2 class="ek-panel__title"><span class="ek-gt">What you get</span></h2>
			<ul class="ek-list ek-list--compact">
				<li>A fast, private chat interface with conversation history and system-prompt control.</li>
				<li>GPU-accelerated inference for thirteen open-weight models out of the box.</li>
				<li>An always-on local API server compatible with OpenAI and Anthropic client libraries.</li>
				<li>Zero ongoing cost after download. No account required.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>

	<p class="prose-block relay-actions">
		<a class="btn ek-cta-btn" href="/downloads/Ekanta-1.0.0-arm64.dmg" download>Download for Apple Silicon</a>
		<a class="inline-back" href="/products">← All products</a>
	</p>
</InnerPage>

<style>
	/* ── Hero ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
	.ek-hero {
		position: relative;
		margin: 0 0 2rem;
		padding: 2.75rem 2.5rem 2.25rem;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #060b18 0%, #0a1628 45%, #0d1a3a 75%, #060b18 100%);
		border-radius: 1.25rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.22);
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.ek-hero::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
		height: 2px;
		background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, #3b82f6 30%, #22d3ee 65%, transparent 100%);
	}

	.ek-hero__glow {
		position: absolute;
		top: -100px;
		right: -80px;
		width: 380px;
		height: 380px;
		background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.22) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) 45%, transparent 70%);
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.ek-hero__glow2 {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: -60px;
		left: -40px;
		width: 260px;
		height: 260px;
		background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1) 0%, transparent 65%);
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.ek-hero__badge {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
		padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.07em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: #60a5fa;
		background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12);
		border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.28);
		border-radius: 100px;
	}

	/* div, not h1 — avoids InnerPage's global h1 specificity fight */
	.ek-hero__title {
		margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 8vw, 4.25rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.045em;
		line-height: 1.0;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #93c5fd 45%, #22d3ee 100%);
		-webkit-background-clip: text;
		-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
		background-clip: text;
	}

	.ek-hero__tagline {
		margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #e2e8f0;
		max-width: 34rem;
	}

	.ek-hero__desc {
		margin: 0 0 1.85rem;
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
		color: #94a3b8;
		max-width: 37rem;
	}

	.ek-hero__buttons {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.ek-dl {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0.7rem 1.35rem;
		border-radius: 0.6rem;
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: background 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
		color: #e2e8f0;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13);
	}

	.ek-dl--primary {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8 0%, #2563eb 55%, #3b82f6 100%);
		border-color: transparent;
		color: #fff;
		box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.45), 0 4px 14px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.22);
	}

	.ek-dl--primary:hover {
		box-shadow: 0 0 32px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.6), 0 4px 18px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
		transform: translateY(-1px);
	}

	.ek-dl:not(.ek-dl--primary):hover {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13);
		transform: translateY(-1px);
	}

	.ek-dl__sub {
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		font-weight: 400;
		opacity: 0.65;
	}

	.ek-hero__note {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		color: #3b4a5e;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	/* ── Feature pills ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
	.ek-pills {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin: 0 0 2.75rem;
	}

	.ek-pill {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.45rem;
		padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #93c5fd;
		background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.07);
		border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18);
		border-radius: 100px;
	}

	.ek-pill__dot {
		width: 5px;
		height: 5px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: #3b82f6;
		box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.8);
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	/* ── Gradient text helper (used on h2 spans and panel title spans) ───── */
	.ek-gt {
		background: linear-gradient(90deg, #60a5fa 0%, #22d3ee 100%);
		-webkit-background-clip: text;
		-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
		background-clip: text;
	}

	/* ── Lists ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
	.ek-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
	}

	.ek-list li {
		padding: 0.4rem 0 0.4rem 1.4rem;
		margin: 0;
		position: relative;
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	.ek-list li::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		top: 0.85em;
		width: 6px;
		height: 6px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #22d3ee);
		box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.55);
	}

	.ek-list--compact li {
		padding-top: 0.25rem;
		padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
	}

	/* ── Two-col panels ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
	.ek-two-col {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 1rem;
		margin: 2.5rem 0 1.5rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 580px) {
		.ek-two-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
	}

	.ek-panel {
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.04);
		border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12);
		border-radius: 0.875rem;
	}

	.ek-panel__title {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
	}

	/* ── Code ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
	code {
		font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;
		font-size: 0.875em;
		background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
		padding: 0.15em 0.45em;
		border-radius: 0.3rem;
		color: #93c5fd;
		border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.22);
	}

	/* ── Bottom CTA ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
	.relay-actions {
		margin-top: 2rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem 1rem;
	}

	.ek-cta-btn {
		color: #fff;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8, #3b82f6);
		box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.38), 0 4px 12px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
	}

	.ek-cta-btn:hover {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #60a5fa);
		box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.55), 0 4px 16px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.28);
		transform: translateY(-1px);
	}

	.inline-back {
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.inline-back:hover { color: #60a5fa; }
</style>
